{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127131840114-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127135709\"/><p>救護員接報到場。</p><p>天水圍發生交通意外。今午(27日)1時01分，一輛屋苑穿梭巴士及一輛私家車，駛至天耀路與天河路交界意外相撞，屋苑穿梭巴士車頭損毀，私家車左車身毀爛。救護車接報到場將傷者送院治理，意外原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:23:53.412606+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:18:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:37:27.501881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:27.050938+00:00","content_hash":"4e6d24419ddf31d43f6acedcaf960582c5c56bc3d6500cb508f382242f4217c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}